#!/bin/sh
exec xmessage -center -buttons 'Explore:0' 'CantripOS · Debian + IceWM

Open Chromium, Files, or Terminal from the bottom-left menu.
The default user is cantrip. sudo needs no password.

This is the OS foundation for personal testing.
Desktop configuration: /etc/X11/icewm
Personal overrides: ~/.icewm
Documents and browser data live in your home directory.

System changes made in a container survive restart, but must be
added to the build source to survive image replacement.'
